  "slug": "arroz-rojo",
  "name": "Arroz Rojo",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "A great recipe for Mexican style rice in tomato sauce. This is an excellent side dish for the Slow Cooker Pozole on this site.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat the lard in a large heavy skillet over medium-high heat. Add the rice, and stir until rice is toasted. Add the garlic and onion; cook and stir until the onion just begins to brown. Stir in the tomatoes, tomato sauce, chicken broth, chili powder and salt. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low, cover, and cook for 20 to 25 minutes, or until rice is tender. Let stand for 5 minutes, covered, before serving."
    }
  ],
